        "rationale": "All five workflows got a deliberate decision, and the required `unit-tests` check takes the one shape that works: tests.yml has no workflow-level `paths` or `paths-ignore`, a `Detect relevant changes` step sets a computed `run` output, every real step is gated on it with `if:`, there is no companion skip workflow, and the step runs the tests if the diff fails (e.g. a zero `before` SHA); the only gap is that nothing was run to confirm the logic."
